<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">TERMS</p><h1>Website terms.</h1><p class="lede">This site describes Sentinel Agency's recruiting and staffing services. Content is general information and does not itself create an employment, staffing, representation, exclusivity or placement agreement.</p><div class="cards"><article><span>01</span><h3>Roles change</h3><p>Job availability, compensation, location and requirements may change or close without notice.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>No guarantee</h3><p>Submitting interest does not guarantee an interview, placement, engagement or employment relationship.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Commercial terms</h3><p>Employer fees, guarantees, contract staffing rates and candidate representation terms are governed by separate written agreements.</p></article></div><p>These launch terms are intentionally conservative and should be replaced by counsel-reviewed operating terms before production intake or commercial transactions begin.</p></section>
</SiteLayout>
